{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kaal Yoddha(Demo)</strong> invites you to step into the role of Prince Avyaan, a skilled warrior drawn to the tranquil forests of <strong>Nirjalvana</strong>. Yet beneath the forest\u2019s serene facade, a nameless dread lingers\u2014one that threatens the very peace of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an Enigmatic Forest</strong><br>Traverse winding paths, cross moss-clad bridges, and uncover the hidden lore behind a growing darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in Dynamic Combat</strong><br>Hone your swordsmanship and archery to stand against lurking foes. Each battle will test your reflexes, strategy, and willpower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel the Secrets</strong><br>Unravel the forest\u2019s secrets as you learn of a power that must be confronted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric World-Building</strong><br>Discover the subtle hints of an ancient heritage as you piece together fragments of the forest\u2019s storied past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brave the unknown paths of Nirjalvana and uncover the source of its silent menace.</strong> Will your valor be enough to banish the darkness, or will it consume all that stands in its way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out in this <strong>demo</strong> for <strong>Kaal Yoddha</strong>\u2014a taste of the epic journey awaiting those willing to face the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3464170?t=1739955109","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3464170?t=1739955109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464170/4d142fdeec06ac2c3c0d44e414f23c0de463e0c4/capsule